# UGC batch vision follow-up

Vision root: `D:\ugc-batch-vision\`

When `D:\ugc-batch-vision\audit\COMPLETE.md` exists or `SESSION.json` has `completed >= 5` / `active: false`:

1. Read every `audit/post-NN/` folder: timeline, ollama calls, chunks, finals, caption, quality-scan, errors.
2. Read matching `batch/Batch_*/Post NN/` PNGs + meta.json + caption.txt.
3. Read `pc-logs/server.jsonl` for the full event stream.
4. Cluster issues and propose fortress fixes (file-level).

Logging auto-stops after 5 posts.
